  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Twelve full NWH trucks race through a giant Arctic mountain valley while
    a genuine moving snow front and rolling debris pursue them. Choose the broad
    winding safer road or risky cliff, ravine and ice-bridge shortcuts. Initial real
    snow contact pushes and obscures your truck; you have a configurable4.5second
    escape window before burial. Accelerate out and exposure recedes. Placement uses
    actual full-body finish time; eliminated trucks rank by distance survived. Other
    racers continue after the leader finishes. Drive, brake, horn, chase/cab/elevated
    cameras, free look, pause/reconnect, selected weather, results, recorded highlights
    and rematch use the collection controls. Hold ACTION to recover only when overturned/stuck
    on the course; recovery places you behind your current progress and never removes
    snow exposure. AI drives real routes, chooses risk by difficulty and recovers
    through the same rules. Normal snow/ice traction and gravity remain active.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
